    title: "Saudi-born engineer for OpenAI arrested for planting listening bug",
    summary: "OpenAI says it discovered a hidden recording device in one of its offices, wrapped in toilet paper behind a television.",
    preview: "OpenAI says it discovered a hidden recording device in one of its offices, wrapped in toilet paper and tucked behind a television. The company says it used its AI models to help trace the device to a Saudi engineer who allegedly planted it. Al Jazeera’s Alan Fisher reports from Washington DC.",
    body: "OpenAI says it discovered a hidden recording device in one of its offices, wrapped in toilet paper and tucked behind a television. The company says it used its AI models to help trace the device to a Saudi engineer who allegedly planted it. Al Jazeera’s Alan Fisher reports from Washington DC.",
